msgstr "Vörlagenpleger"

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, m_introLabel)
#: ui/template_management_dialog_base.ui:26
msgctxt "@label"
msgid ""
"Select a template and click <i>Apply</i> to apply it to this item. Click "
"<i>New</i> to create a new template based on the current item settings."
msgstr ""
"Söök en Vörlaag ut un klick op <i>Bruken</i>, denn warrt dat för den Indrag "
"bruukt. Klick op <i>Nieg</i>, wenn Du en nieg Vörlaag opstellen wullt, de op "
"de aktuellen Ingaven opbuut."

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QListWidget, m_listBox)
#: ui/template_management_dialog_base.ui:42
msgid "The list of managed templates"
msgstr "De List vun pleegt Vörlagen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QListWidget, m_listBox)
#: ui/template_management_dialog_base.ui:45
msgid ""
"This is a list of all the templates you have currently accessible for "
"creating new calendar items."
msgstr ""
"Dit is en List vun all Vörlagen, de Du opstunns för't Opstellen vun nieg "
"Kalennerindrääg bruken kannst."

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QPushButton, m_buttonAdd)
#: ui/template_management_dialog_base.ui:56
msgid "Create a new template from the current settings"
msgstr "En nieg Vörlaag mit de aktuelle Instellen opstellen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QPushButton, m_buttonAdd)
#: ui/template_management_dialog_base.ui:59
msgid ""
"Click on this button to create a new template based on the current settings "
"in the editor. You can use this template to quickly add new items in the "
"future."
msgstr ""
"Klick op dissen Knoop, wenn Du en nieg Vörlaag mit de aktuellen Editor-"
"Instellen opstellen wullt. Du kannst disse Vörlaag later bruken, wenn Du gau "
"nieg Indrääg tofögen wullt."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, m_buttonAdd)
#: ui/template_management_dialog_base.ui:62
msgid "&New..."
msgstr "&Nieg..."

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QPushButton, m_buttonRemove)
#: ui/template_management_dialog_base.ui:72
msgid "Remove the currently selected template"
msgstr "De opstunns utsöcht Vörlaag wegmaken"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QPushButton, m_buttonRemove)
#: ui/template_management_dialog_base.ui:75
msgid ""
"Clicking this button will permanently remove the selected template from your "
"list of managed templates."
msgstr ""
"Klick op dissen Knoop, wenn Du de utsöchte Vörlaag duerhaftig ut Dien "
"Vörlagenlist wegmaken wullt."

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QPushButton, m_buttonApply)
#: ui/template_management_dialog_base.ui:85
msgid "Apply the selected template settings"
msgstr "Utsöchte Vörlageninstellen anwennen"

#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QPushButton, m_buttonApply)
#: ui/template_management_dialog_base.ui:88
msgid ""
"Clicking this button will apply the settings from the selected template to "
"the item you are currently editing."
msgstr ""
"Klick op dissen Knoop, wenn Du de utsöcht Vörlaag ehr Instellen för den "
"Indrag bruken wullt, den Du jüst bewerkst."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QPushButton, m_buttonApply)
#: ui/template_management_dialog_base.ui:91
msgid "Apply"
msgstr "Bruken"

#: visualfreebusywidget.cpp:154
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Scale: "
msgstr "Skala: "

#: visualfreebusywidget.cpp:159
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Set the Gantt chart zoom level"
msgstr "De Ansichtgrött för't Gantt-Diagramm fastleggen"

#: visualfreebusywidget.cpp:162
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Select the Gantt chart zoom level from one of the following:<nl/>'Hour' "
"shows a range of several hours,<nl/>'Day' shows a range of a few days,<nl/"
">'Week' shows a range of a few months,<nl/>and 'Month' shows a range of a "
"few years,<nl/>while 'Automatic' selects the range most appropriate for the "
"current event or to-do."
msgstr ""
"Leggt de Ansichtgrött för't Gantt-Diagramm fast:<nl/>\"Stünnen\" wiest en "
"Rebeet vun Stünnen,<nl/>\"Daag\" en vun en poor Daag,<nl/>\"Weken\" wiest en "
"poor Maanden un<nl/>\"Maanden\" wiest en poor Johr.<nl/>\"Automaatsch\" "
"leggt dat Tietrebeet na den aktuellen Indrag fast."

#: visualfreebusywidget.cpp:169
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox range in hours"
msgid "Hour"
msgstr "Stünnen"

#: visualfreebusywidget.cpp:171
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox range in days"
msgid "Day"
msgstr "Daag"

#: visualfreebusywidget.cpp:173
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox range in weeks"
msgid "Week"
msgstr "Weken"

#: visualfreebusywidget.cpp:175
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox range in months"
msgid "Month"
msgstr "Maanden"

#: visualfreebusywidget.cpp:177
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox range is computed automatically"
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "Automaatsch"

#: visualfreebusywidget.cpp:183
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Center on Start"
msgstr "Anfang in de Merrn"

#: visualfreebusywidget.cpp:186
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Center the Gantt chart on the event start date and time"
msgstr "Anfangtiet un -datum na de Merrn vun't Gantt-Diagramm setten"

#: visualfreebusywidget.cpp:189
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Click this button to center the Gantt chart on the start time and day of "
"this event."
msgstr ""
"Klick op dissen Knoop, wenn Du Anfangtiet un -datum vun't Gantt-Diagramm na "
"de Merrn setten wullt."

#: visualfreebusywidget.cpp:196
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Pick Date"
msgstr "Datum utsöken"

#: visualfreebusywidget.cpp:199
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Move the event to a date and time when all attendees are available"
msgstr ""
"Dat Begeefnis na en Datum un Tiet verschuven, wenn all Deelnehmers Tiet hebbt"

#: visualfreebusywidget.cpp:203
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Click this button to move the event to a date and time when all the "
"attendees have time available in their Free/Busy lists."
msgstr ""
"Klick op dissen Knoop, wenn Du dat Begeefnis na en Datum un Tiet verschuven "
"wullt, wenn all Deelnehmers Tiet hebbt."

#: visualfreebusywidget.cpp:212
msgctxt "@action:button reload freebusy data"
msgid "Reload"
msgstr "Nieg laden"

#: visualfreebusywidget.cpp:215
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Reload Free/Busy data for all attendees"
msgstr "De Free-/Bunnen-Informatschonen vun all Deelnehmers nieg laden"

#: visualfreebusywidget.cpp:218
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Pressing this button will cause the Free/Busy data for all attendees to be "
"reloaded from their corresponding servers."
msgstr ""
"En Klick op dissen Knoop laadt de Free-/Bunnen-Informatschonen vun all "
"Deelnehmers nieg vun de tohören Servers."

#: visualfreebusywidget.cpp:237
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Shows the Free/Busy status of all attendees"
msgstr "Wiest den Free-/Bunnen-Status vun all Deelnehmers"

#: visualfreebusywidget.cpp:240
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Shows the Free/Busy status of all attendees. Double-clicking on an "
"attendee's entry in the list will allow you to enter the location of their "
"Free/Busy Information."
msgstr ""
"Wiest de Free-/Bunnen-Informatschonen vun all Deelnehmers. Wenn Du op den "
"Listindrag vun en Deelnehmer dubbelklickst, kannst Du de Steed vun sien "
"Free-/Bunnen-Informatschonen angeven."

